sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as React Client
    participant API as Node/Express API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: Query User by email
    DB-->>API: Return User Document (incl. passwordHash)
    API->>API: bcrypt.compare(password, passwordHash)
    API->>API: Sign JWT token
    API-->>Client: 200 OK { token }
    Note over Client,API: Subsequent Requests
    Client->>API: GET /api/match/find (Header: Authorization: Bearer token)
    API->>API: Validate Token
    API->>DB: Fetch Match Data
    DB-->>API: Match Documents
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Matches JSON)
